WITH base AS (SELECT * FROM shipments WHERE carrier = 'Flash' AND (carrier <> 'DHL' OR cost >= 27)), summary AS (SELECT status, CASE WHEN carrier IN ('Flash', 'DHL') THEN 'tier_1' ELSE 'other' END carrier_group, MAX(cost) max_cost, SORT_ARRAY(COLLECT_SET(carrier)) carrier_list FROM base GROUP BY status, CASE WHEN carrier IN ('Flash', 'DHL') THEN 'tier_1' ELSE 'other' END) SELECT * FROM summary ORDER BY status, max_cost DESC;
